<fw type="sig" place="bottom">b 3</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">Was</fw><lb/>
<pb n="XXII" facs="#f0027"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#b">Vorrede.</hi></fw><lb/>
<p>Was ferner wahr&#x017F;cheinliche Sa&#x0364;tze noch mißli-<lb/>
